                    "_type": "tile/data-stream",
                    "title": "LCP breakdown (phone)",
                    "description": "The 75th percentile of each part of an image LCP for the site on phone over the last 28 days, in load order. Each part is its own 75th percentile, so they do not add up to the LCP.",
